msgstr "%1$s 返回错误（HTTP %2$d）。%3$s"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:26
msgid "Battle.net"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:42
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-discord.php:42
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-google.php:42
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-twitch.php:42
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "客户端 ID"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:46
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-discord.php:46
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-google.php:46
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-twitch.php:46
#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-yandex.php:46
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "客户端密钥"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:50
msgid "Region"
msgstr "区域"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:53
msgid "Global (America, Europe, Korea, Taiwan)"
msgstr "全球（美洲、欧洲、韩国、台湾）"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:54
msgid "China"
msgstr "中国"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-battlenet.php:71
msgid "Create a client in the Blizzard developer portal and add the redirect URL below. Battle.net does not share e-mail addresses, so new users are asked for one."
msgstr "在 Blizzard 开发者门户中创建客户端并添加下方的重定向 URL。Battle.net 不提供电子邮件地址，因此会要求新用户填写。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-discord.php:26
msgid "Discord"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-discord.php:63
msgid "Create an application in the Discord Developer Portal, open OAuth2, copy Client ID and Client Secret and add the redirect URL below to Redirects."
msgstr "在 Discord Developer Portal 中创建应用，打开 OAuth2，复制 Client ID 和 Client Secret，并将下方的重定向 URL 添加到 Redirects。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-google.php:26
msgid "Google"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-google.php:63
msgid "In Google Cloud Console configure the OAuth consent screen, then create an \"OAuth client ID\" of type \"Web application\" and add the redirect URL below to \"Authorized redirect URIs\"."
msgstr "在 Google Cloud Console 中配置 OAuth 同意屏幕，然后创建类型为“Web 应用”的“OAuth 客户端 ID”，并将下方的重定向 URL 添加到“已获授权的重定向 URI”。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:28
msgid "Steam"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:44
msgid "Steam Web API key (optional)"
msgstr "Steam Web API 密钥（可选）"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:46
msgid "Without a key the nickname and avatar are read from the public community profile."
msgstr "没有密钥时，将从公开的社区资料中读取昵称和头像。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:69
msgid "Steam needs no application: just enable it. Steam does not share e-mail addresses, so new users are asked for one. A Web API key is optional."
msgstr "Steam 无需创建应用：直接启用即可。Steam 不提供电子邮件地址，因此会要求新用户填写。Web API 密钥为可选项。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:150
msgid "Invalid response from Steam."
msgstr "Steam 返回了无效响应。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-steam.php:172
msgid "Steam did not confirm the login."
msgstr "Steam 未确认登录。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-twitch.php:26
msgid "Twitch"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-twitch.php:63
msgid "Register an application in the Twitch developer console (category \"Website Integration\", client type \"Confidential\") and add the redirect URL below as OAuth Redirect URL."
msgstr "在 Twitch 开发者控制台中注册应用（类别为 \"Website Integration\"，客户端类型为 \"Confidential\"），并将下方的重定向 URL 添加为 OAuth Redirect URL。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-vk.php:26
msgid "VK ID"
msgstr ""

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-vk.php:42
msgid "App ID"
msgstr "应用 ID"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-vk.php:66
msgid "Create a \"Web\" application in VK ID for business, enable the e-mail permission, set the base domain of the site and add the redirect URL below to the trusted redirect URLs. Copy the App ID."
msgstr "在 VK ID for business 中创建“Web”应用，启用电子邮件权限，设置网站的基础域名，并将下方的重定向 URL 添加到受信任的重定向 URL。复制应用 ID。"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-yandex.php:26
msgid "Yandex ID"
msgstr "Yandex ID"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-yandex.php:42
msgid "ClientID"
msgstr "ClientID"

#: includes/providers/class-nsl-provider-yandex.php:63
msgid "Create a web service application in Yandex OAuth, grant access to the e-mail address, user name and avatar, and add the redirect URL below as Redirect URI."
msgstr "在 Yandex OAuth 中创建 Web 服务应用，授予电子邮件地址、用户名和头像的访问权限，并将下方的重定向 URL 添加为 Redirect URI。"
